#   D2-like  4S 2S1/2 - 4P 2P3/2 at 581.40 nm (vacuum), g_eff = 7/6
# The element ID only fixes abundance and mass; nothing else is Ti.
#
  TI
#
# Nlevel  Nline  Ncont  Nfixed
    4       2      1      0
#
#     E[cm^-1]    g          label[20]         stage   levelNo
