        0.000   2.00 'TI I 4S 2SE         '    0         0
    17000.000   2.00 'TI I 4P 2PO 1       '    0         1
    17200.000   4.00 'TI I 4P 2PO 3       '    0         2
    55000.000   1.00 'TI II 1SE           '    1         3
#
#  j  i     f    type  Nlambda symm  qcore qwing  vdWapprx  c0  c1   c2  c3    Grad     Stark
   1  0  0.30   VOIGT   101    SYMM   1.0  20.0   UNSOLD   1.0 0.0  1.0 0.0  1.00E+08  1.0E-15
   2  0  0.60   VOIGT   101    SYMM   1.0  20.0   UNSOLD   1.0 0.0  1.0 0.0  1.00E+08  1.0E-15
#
#  j  i    alpha [m^2]   Nlambda  type        lambda_min [nm]
   3  0    1.0E-22         20     HYDROGENIC   100.0
#
 TEMP    2         3000.0    30000.0
 OMEGA   1  0      1.0E+00   1.0E+00
 OMEGA   2  0      1.0E+00   1.0E+00
 OMEGA   2  1      1.0E+00   1.0E+00
